			"description": "Internet data the bot used since midnight. Everything the bot sends and receives over the internet: song downloads from YouTube, voice audio, and Discord and web API traffic. It reads a few percent under what your provider counts, because encryption and some packet overhead are not measured.",
			"datasource": {
